  "label": "Sincere Gesture of Hands Over Chest",
  "description": "A gesture often associated with solemnity, sincerity, or patriotism (e.g., placing hands over the heart during the national anthem). In this meme, the man's gesture is juxtaposed with his disengaged expression and cigarette, creating irony. The viewer must understand this gesture's conventional meaning to interpret the meme's satirical intent.",
